      "heading": "What install software is for",
      "html": "<p>A charge point install is an electrical installation. BS 7671 covers it. In England and Wales it is notifiable under Part P. The IET publishes a Code of Practice for EV charging.</p><p>Software helps you record each step as you work, with photos. You stay the competent installer.</p>"
